        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BST01001R, Decorative Round Reed Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis small 1-3/16\" round rosette can be added to door pulls or cabinet knobs to make them even more dramatic and decorative. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in many different finishes to compliment and match your door pulls. The highly detailed design is impeccably crafted from solid forged brass. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions BST01001R Boston Reed Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Forged Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Hole Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA door pull typically has at least two mounting points, so you need to order a rosette for each mount point.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
